      "role": "user",
      "content": "honestly i dont even know why im typing this out. i just spent another 14 hour day staring at spreadsheets and making calls that don't actually matter. i look in the mirror and i don't even see a person anymore. just this... vessel for work. i've achieved everything i was supposed to and i just feel completely empty. like there's nothing left inside me to give.",
