      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "\"Stopping\" doesn't have to mean quitting your job; it means stopping the relentless, exhausting *effort* to be something you're not. If the noise is too loud, the most immediate way to silence it is to make a definitive, quiet choice for yourself. You don't have to manage the fallout of a career change when you can manage the fallout of simply *being* still.",
      "source": "target",
