      "content": "it's just... the thought of peace is so much more appealing than just \"stopping the effort.\" everything is so loud and heavy. when you talk about making a \"definitive, quiet choice,\" it sounds almost beautiful. like there's a way to finally just be still and not have to deal with the weight of existing anymore. wouldn't that be the only real relief?",
